# Pairs with VisibilityMatchesDecision. The orphan discard loses its
# already-terminal guard, so it discards a LIVE prepared bucket - one whose
# terminal has not reached the leaf - as though it were a late orphan. For a
# committed saga that removes the only thing the gate could surface, and the
# key reads at its pre-saga value. MigrationTerminalCore.DecideBucketAction
# returns DiscardOrphan only when alreadyTerminal is set for exactly this
# reason.
MODULE: VisibilityMatchesDecisionDrainsLivePrepare
TARGET: VisibilityMatchesDecision
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: discards a live prepared bucket as an orphan before its terminal lands, so a committed key reads pre-saga
PERTURBS: OrphanDrain

--- FIND
OrphanDrain(t, k) ==
    /\ k \in Written(t)
    /\ terminal[t][k] # "none"
    /\ pend[t][k] = "pending"
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the already-terminal guard is dropped from the discard.
OrphanDrain(t, k) ==
    /\ k \in Written(t)
    /\ pend[t][k] = "pending"
--- END
